## Lab 5.A — Router Setup and Routing

### 1. Router Interfaces & IP Forwarding Persistence
IP forwarding is permanently enabled on the Router VM in `/etc/sysctl.conf`:

```ini
net.ipv4.ip_forward=1
net.ipv6.conf.all.forwarding=1

